en edge, shallow reflective water tray, frosted sea-glass acrylic background, soft water-caustic reflections, clinical Korean beauty aesthetic, large diffused softbox from upper left, cyan bounce, subtle rim light, medium-format 80mm lens, f/8, crisp premium retouching, clean whites and teal accents, no alternate products, no text overlay, not a catalog packshot\",\"productHandling\":\"Show the exact Pure Korean Marine Collagen Peptides jar from Wellbeing Nutrition only: stout wide-mouth cylindrical white plastic jar, matte white flat screw lid, full-wrap white-to-cyan teal gradient label, black Wellbeing Nutrition logo, teal-blue central panel, large white lowercase serif 'marine collagen' type, Korean text, Type I & III, Unflavored badge, geodesic sphere badge, clinically approved badge, 8g collagen callout, icon row, and 200 g details. Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, relabel, or replace the product. Front label must be clean, undamaged, proportionally accurate, and readable.\",\"twoLineShotIdea\":\"A premium morning beauty ritual frame: the Pure Korean Marine Collagen Peptides jar sits off-center on a translucent aqua glass slab, surrounded by a clear water glass, a white ceramic scoop, and subtle marine textures. Soft water-caustic reflections and clean Korean skincare minimalism make the scene feel clinical, fresh, and sensorial rather than like a catalog product shot.\",\"productFocusMode\":\"styled\",\"subjectPlacement\":\"Product on the right third, slightly forward of the background elements; glass and scoop on the left foreground; translucent slab running diagonally to create movement and depth.\",\"productFrameShare\":\"Approximately 38% of the frame, large enough to read as the hero but balanced with glass, scoop, water texture, and surface design.\",\"whyThisIsNotACatalogPackshot\":\"The product is not centered on a blank background; it is integrated into a designed ritual scene with layered surfaces, foreground props, diagonal composition, water re