powder beside the jar, a clear tumbler filled with water, a few smooth white pebbles, and a folded ivory linen napkin at the edge of frame. No alternate products, no competing labels, no fish imagery, no text overlays.\",\"shotTitle\":\"Deep-Sea Beauty Ritual\",\"colorGrade\":\"Clean clinical-beauty grade with crisp whites, cyan-teal accents, soft warm skin-toned neutrals in the linen, restrained contrast, lifted shadows, and polished specular control. Retouching should preserve real material texture while removing dust, label warping, and distracting reflections.\",\"composition\":\"Horizontal 4:5 campaign frame with the product placed on the right third, turned nearly straight to camera with a very slight 5-degree angle so the front label remains fully readable. A tall glass of water and white scoop occupy the left foreground, partially cropped, while a translucent aqua glass platform creates a diagonal line from lower left to upper right. Background layers include soft blurred rippled glass and pale marine-toned acrylic panels, creating depth and a premium editorial still-life layout.\",\"cameraDistance\":\"Medium close still-life distance, about 90 cm from product, with the jar filling the right third and environmental details visible around it.\",\"cameraSettings\":\"ISO 50, f/8, 1/125 sec, tethered capture, manual focus stacked lightly if needed to keep the product label sharp while letting foreground glass edges fall slightly soft\",\"promptFragment\":\"Premium commercial product photoshoot of the exact Wellbeing Nutrition Pure Korean Marine Collagen Peptides jar, stout white cylindrical jar with matte white flat screw lid and accurate white-to-cyan teal label, front label fully readable, placed off-center on the right third on a translucent aqua glass slab, clear water tumbler and white ceramic scoop with fine collagen powder in left foreground, smooth white pebbles, ivory linen edge, shallow reflective water tray, frosted sea-glass acrylic background, soft 