veId\":null,\"quickShootDirection\":{\"lens\":\"Schneider Kreuznach 80mm LS, shot at approximately 80mm for natural product proportions and premium still-life compression\",\"mood\":\"Fresh, clinical, elevated, aquatic, calm, and aspirational — a daily beauty ritual with premium Korean marine wellness cues.\",\"camera\":\"Phase One XF IQ4 150MP or equivalent high-resolution medium-format studio camera on tripod\",\"lighting\":\"Large diffused key light from upper left through a 4x6 silk for soft beauty highlights on the matte white lid and jar shoulders. Low-intensity cyan bounce from below to echo the label gradient and create gentle aquatic reflections. A narrow gridded rim light from back right catches the lid edge and glassware. Project very soft water-caustic patterns across the background and surface, keeping them subtle enough not to obscure the label.\",\"shotType\":\"Premium styled product still life with ritual props and environmental lighting effects\",\"sceneRole\":\"Communicates the product as a refined daily collagen ritual for hydration, firmness, and beauty optimization, while visually referencing marine purity and clean clinical testing.\",\"setDesign\":\"Minimal luxury wellness set using frosted sea-glass acrylic, translucent aqua resin, pale warm-white ceramic, and a shallow tray with a thin veil of water for subtle reflections. Add a small white ceramic scoop with fine collagen powder beside the jar, a clear tumbler filled with water, a few smooth white pebbles, and a folded ivory linen napkin at the edge of frame. No alternate products, no competing labels, no fish imagery, no text overlays.\",\"shotTitle\":\"Deep-Sea Beauty Ritual\",\"colorGrade\":\"Clean clinical-beauty grade with crisp whites, cyan-teal accents, soft warm skin-toned neutrals in the linen, restrained contrast, lifted shadows, and polished specular control. Retouching should preserve real material texture while removing dust, label warping, and distracting reflections.\",\"comp