ate, and readable.\",\"twoLineShotIdea\":\"A premium morning beauty ritual frame: the Pure Korean Marine Collagen Peptides jar sits off-center on a translucent aqua glass slab, surrounded by a clear water glass, a white ceramic scoop, and subtle marine textures. Soft water-caustic reflections and clean Korean skincare minimalism make the scene feel clinical, fresh, and sensorial rather than like a catalog product shot.\",\"productFocusMode\":\"styled\",\"subjectPlacement\":\"Product on the right third, slightly forward of the background elements; glass and scoop on the left foreground; translucent slab running diagonally to create movement and depth.\",\"productFrameShare\":\"Approximately 38% of the frame, large enough to read as the hero but balanced with glass, scoop, water texture, and surface design.\",\"whyThisIsNotACatalogPackshot\":\"The product is not centered on a blank background; it is integrated into a designed ritual scene with layered surfaces, foreground props, diagonal composition, water reflections, partial crops, and atmospheric lighting. The jar remains accurate and readable but shares attention with the premium marine-inspired set.\"},\"moodboardCellImageUrl\":null,\"moodboardCellDirection\":null,\"userReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"generativeLookPrintable\":null,\"previousQuickShootIdeas\":[],\"styleReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"generativeLookArtworkUrl\":null,\"quickShootDirectionModel\":\"gpt-5.5\",\"referenceCompositionModel\":\"google/gemini-3.1-flash-lite\",\"normalizedReferenceImageUrls\":[],\"quickShootBatchDirectionIndex\":0,\"usedNormalizedReferenceImages\":false,\"quickShootBatchDirectionPlanned\":true,\"referenceCompositionDescriptions\":[]},\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-15T18:20:37.750Z\",\"variations\":[{\"id\":\"5ab0974e-512d-477f-ac85-afbc8292320e\",\"creativeVersionId\":\"c6047369-bf80-4083-9e33-dca72be780e1\",\"variationType\":\"size\",\"variationKey\":\"original\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024,\"aspectRatio\":null,\"platform\":null,\"isPrim